```javascript
// Pseudo-code for Automated Safety Pipeline
async function safeUpload(videoPath, metadata) {
  // 1. Local Pre-processing
  const processedVideo = await applySafetyFilters(videoPath); 
  
  // 2. Upload as Unlisted
  const videoId = await youtubeApi.upload(processedVideo, {
    privacyStatus: 'unlisted',
    ...metadata
  });

  // 3. Poll for Content ID Status
  let isSafe = false;
  for (let i = 0; i < 6; i++) { // Wait max 12 mins
    await sleep(120000); 
    const status = await youtubeApi.getVideoStatus(videoId);
    
    if (!status.contentDetails.contentRating && !status.status.privacyStatus.includes('blocked')) {
      isSafe = true;
      break;
    }
  }

  // 4. Final Decision
  if (isSafe) {
    await youtubeApi.updatePrivacy(videoId, 'public');
    console.log('✅ Video Published Safely');
  } else {
    await youtubeApi.deleteVideo(videoId);
    console.log('❌ Copyright Detected - Auto Deleted');
  }
}
```

### ⚠️ Zaroori Chetawani (Disclaimer)
*   **Automation Limits:** YouTube ki API mein daily quota limits hoti hain. Har video ko check karne mein API calls kharch hongi.
*   **False Positives:** Kabhi-kabhi original content bhi claim ho jata hai. Hamesha manual review ka option rakhein.
*   **Terms of Service:** YouTube ki policy ke against automated mass-uploading ya circumvention tools use karna channel ban ka karan ban sakta hai. Hamesha "Transformative Content" (Fair Use) par focus karein.

