### ⚙️ PART 2: AUTOMATION WORKFLOW FIX (Rix Check Nahi Kar Raha?)

Aapne kaha ki abhi wo direct public upload kar raha hai aur Rix check nahi kar raha. Iska matlab automation pipeline mein **"Safety Gate"** missing hai. Client ID/Secret Key ka use karke ye flow banayein:

```text
[Source Download] 
       ↓
[Local Pre-Processing (FFmpeg Filters)] 
       ↓
[AI Safety Score Check (Prompt based)] → If Risk > 6 → REJECT
       ↓
[YouTube API Upload as UNLISTED] 
       ↓
[WAIT 10 MINS + Poll Content ID Status] 
       ↓
[IF SAFE] → Update to PUBLIC/SCHEDULED + Generate SEO Metadata
[IF CLAIM] → Auto Delete + Log Error + Blacklist Source
```

**Client ID/Secret Key Setup:**
*   Google Cloud Console se YouTube Data API v3 enable karein.
*   OAuth 2.0 credentials banayein.
*   Node.js mein `googleapis` library use karke `youtube.videos.insert` call karein with `privacyStatus: 'unlisted'`.
*   Phir `youtube.videos.list` se `contentDetails.contentRating` check karein.

